    "summary": "When the battle ends, the player with more VP wins; equal VP is a draw. VP above these limits is ignored:\n\n- **PRIMARY MISSION**: **45VP**, at most **15VP** per battle round.\n- **SECONDARY MISSIONS**: **45VP**, at most **15VP** per battle round and at most **20VP** from each Fixed Secondary Mission card.\n- **BATTLE READY ARMY**: **10VP** for an army painted to Battle Ready standard.",
